<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>System administration — MedSupply Portal</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('../partials/header') %>
  <main class="container main-content admin-main">
    <% if (typeof message !== 'undefined' && message) { %>
      <div class="alert info admin-dashboard-flash"><%= message %></div>
    <% } %>
    <nav class="admin-dashboard-kpis" aria-label="Quick access to key areas">
      <a href="/admin/companies" class="admin-kpi-card">
        <div class="admin-kpi-card-head">
          <span class="admin-kpi-card-title">Organizations</span>
          <span class="admin-kpi-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 21h18"/><path d="M5 21V7l8-4v18"/><path d="M19 21V11l-6-4"/><path d="M9 9v.01"/><path d="M9 12v.01"/><path d="M9 15v.01"/><path d="M9 18v.01"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="admin-kpi-card-spacer"></div>
        <div class="admin-kpi-card-value" aria-label="Total organizations"><%= companyCount %></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/admin/users" class="admin-kpi-card">
        <div class="admin-kpi-card-head">
          <span class="admin-kpi-card-title">All users</span>
          <span class="admin-kpi-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="admin-kpi-card-spacer"></div>
        <div class="admin-kpi-card-value" aria-label="Total users"><%= userCount %></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/documents?approvalStatus=PENDING" class="admin-kpi-card">
        <div class="admin-kpi-card-head">
          <span class="admin-kpi-card-title">New documents</span>
          <span class="admin-kpi-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"/><polyline points="10 9 9 9 8 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="admin-kpi-card-spacer"></div>
        <span class="admin-kpi-card-hint">Awaiting approval</span>
        <div class="admin-kpi-card-value" aria-label="Documents pending approval"><%= pendingApprovalCount %></div>
      </a>
      <a href="/documents" class="admin-kpi-card">
        <div class="admin-kpi-card-head">
          <span class="admin-kpi-card-title">Upload rate</span>
          <span class="admin-kpi-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><polyline points="23 6 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 1 18"/><polyline points="17 6 23 6 23 12"/></svg>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="admin-kpi-card-spacer"></div>
        <span class="admin-kpi-card-hint">Uploaded this month</span>
        <div class="admin-kpi-card-value-row">
          <div class="admin-kpi-card-value" aria-label="Documents uploaded this month"><%= docUploadsThisMonth %></div>
          <% if (typeof docUploadDeltaText !== 'undefined' && docUploadDeltaText) { %>
            <span class="admin-kpi-card-meta-delta <%= typeof docUploadDeltaClass !== 'undefined' ? docUploadDeltaClass : 'is-neutral' %>"><%= docUploadDeltaText %></span>
          <% } %>
        </div>
      </a>
    </nav>

    <div class="admin-dashboard-alerts" aria-label="Recent action items">
      <section class="admin-dashboard-alert-card" aria-labelledby="dash-pending-docs-title">
        <div class="admin-dashboard-alert-head">
          <h2 id="dash-pending-docs-title" class="admin-dashboard-alert-heading">Recent documents awaiting approval</h2>
          <% var _pd = typeof adminRecentPendingDocs !== 'undefined' && adminRecentPendingDocs ? adminRecentPendingDocs : []; %>
          <% if (_pd.length) { %>
            <a href="/documents?approvalStatus=PENDING" class="admin-dashboard-alert-more">View all in library</a>
          <% } %>
        </div>
        <% if (!_pd.length) { %>
          <p class="admin-dashboard-alert-empty muted">None right now.</p>
        <% } else { %>
          <div class="doc-list admin-pending-doc-wrap">
            <table class="data-table doc-explorer-table admin-pending-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th scope="col" class="col-name">Document name</th>
                  <th scope="col" class="col-company">Organization</th>
                  <th scope="col" class="col-date">Date</th>
                  <th scope="col" class="col-actions">Actions</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
            <% _pd.forEach(function(d) {
              var _t = (d.title || d.original_filename || 'Document').toString().trim() || 'Untitled';
              var _dateStr = new Date(d.created_at).toLocaleDateString(undefined, { month: 'short', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' });
              var _company = (d.company_name || '—').toString();
              var _up = (d.uploader_name || '').toString().trim() || '—';
              var _em = (d.uploader_email || '').toString();
              var _cid = d.company_id;
              var _titleAttr = _t.replace(/"/g, '&quot;');
            %>
                <tr>
                  <td class="col-name">
                    <button type="button" class="admin-pending-doc-name-btn js-dash-preview" title="Preview document"
                      aria-label="Preview: <%= _titleAttr %>"
                      data-preview="<%= encodeURIComponent(JSON.stringify({ id: d.id, title: _t, company: _company, date: _dateStr, uploader: _up, email: _em })) %>"><%= _t %></button>
                  </td>
                  <td class="col-company" title="<%= _company.replace(/"/g, '&quot;') %>"><%= _company %></td>
                  <td class="col-date"><%= _dateStr %></td>
                  <td class="col-actions">
                    <% if (_cid) { %>
                    <form method="post" action="/admin/companies/<%= _cid %>/documents/<%= d.id %>/approval" class="doc-action-form">
                      <input type="hidden" name="approval_status" value="APPROVED">
                      <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="/admin">
                      <button type="submit" class="doc-action-btn doc-action-approve" title="Approve document" aria-label="Approve document">
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg>
                      </button>
                    </form>
                    <form method="post" action="/admin/companies/<%= _cid %>/documents/<%= d.id %>/approval" class="doc-action-form" onsubmit="return confirm('Reject this document? The client can upload a new version if needed.');">
                      <input type="hidden" name="approval_status" value="REJECTED">
                      <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="/admin">
                      <button type="submit" class="doc-action-btn doc-action-reject" title="Reject document" aria-label="Reject document">
                        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg>
                      </button>
                    </form>
                    <% } else { %>
                    <span class="admin-pending-no-company muted" title="Missing organization on uploader — open document in library to resolve">—</span>
                    <% } %>
                  </td>
                </tr>
            <% }); %>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        <% } %>
      </section>

      <section class="admin-dashboard-alert-card admin-dashboard-alert-card--onboarding" aria-labelledby="dash-onboarding-title">
        <div class="admin-dashboard-alert-head">
          <h2 id="dash-onboarding-title" class="admin-dashboard-alert-heading">Client onboarding</h2>
          <% var _ob = typeof adminOnboardingCompanies !== 'undefined' && adminOnboardingCompanies ? adminOnboardingCompanies : []; %>
          <% if (_ob.length) { %>
            <a href="/admin/companies" class="admin-dashboard-alert-more">Organization management</a>
          <% } %>
        </div>
        <p class="admin-dashboard-alert-lede muted">Organizations that still need a manager.</p>
        <% if (!_ob.length) { %>
          <p class="admin-dashboard-alert-empty muted">None right now.</p>
        <% } else { %>
          <ul class="admin-dashboard-alert-list">
            <% _ob.forEach(function(c) { %>
            <li>
              <a href="/admin/companies/<%= c.id %>/admins/new" class="admin-dashboard-alert-link">
                <span class="admin-dashboard-alert-primary"><%= c.name %></span>
                <span class="admin-dashboard-alert-meta">Added <%= new Date(c.created_at).toLocaleDateString(undefined, { month: 'short', day: 'numeric', year: 'numeric' }) %> · Add manager</span>
              </a>
            </li>
            <% }); %>
          </ul>
        <% } %>
      </section>
    </div>

    <dialog id="admin-dash-preview-dialog" class="admin-dash-preview-dialog" aria-labelledby="admin-dash-preview-title">
      <div class="admin-dash-preview-inner">
        <div class="admin-dash-preview-toolbar">
          <h3 id="admin-dash-preview-title" class="admin-dash-preview-title">Document preview</h3>
          <button type="button" class="admin-dash-preview-close" id="admin-dash-preview-close" aria-label="Close preview">&times;</button>
        </div>
        <div class="admin-dash-preview-meta" id="admin-dash-preview-meta"></div>
        <iframe class="admin-dash-preview-iframe" id="admin-dash-preview-iframe" title="Document file preview"></iframe>
      </div>
    </dialog>

    <script>
    (function () {
      var dlg = document.getElementById('admin-dash-preview-dialog');
      var iframe = document.getElementById('admin-dash-preview-iframe');
      var meta = document.getElementById('admin-dash-preview-meta');
      var closeBtn = document.getElementById('admin-dash-preview-close');
      function closePreview() {
        iframe.removeAttribute('src');
        meta.innerHTML = '';
        if (dlg && typeof dlg.close === 'function') dlg.close();
      }
      if (closeBtn) closeBtn.addEventListener('click', closePreview);
      if (dlg) dlg.addEventListener('cancel', function (e) { e.preventDefault(); closePreview(); });
      document.querySelectorAll('.js-dash-preview').forEach(function (btn) {
        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
          var raw = btn.getAttribute('data-preview');
          if (!raw) return;
          var p = JSON.parse(decodeURIComponent(raw));
          var who = p.uploader;
          if (p.email) who += ' · ' + p.email;
          meta.innerHTML =
            '<dl class="admin-dash-preview-dl">' +
            '<div><dt>Document</dt><dd>' + escapeHtml(p.title) + '</dd></div>' +
            '<div><dt>Organization</dt><dd>' + escapeHtml(p.company) + '</dd></div>' +
            '<div><dt>Date</dt><dd>' + escapeHtml(p.date) + '</dd></div>' +
            '<div><dt>Sent by</dt><dd>' + escapeHtml(who) + '</dd></div>' +
            '</dl>';
          iframe.src = '/documents/' + encodeURIComponent(p.id) + '/view';
          dlg.showModal();
        });
      });
      function escapeHtml(s) {
        var d = document.createElement('div');
        d.textContent = s;
        return d.innerHTML;
      }
    })();
    </script>

    <section class="admin-workflow-panel" aria-labelledby="workflow-intro-title">
      <header class="admin-workflow-panel-header">
        <h2 id="workflow-intro-title" class="admin-workflow-panel-title">Role and workflow</h2>
      </header>

      <div class="admin-overview-flow">
        <h3 class="admin-overview-flow-title">Operational workflow</h3>
        <ol class="admin-workflow-timeline">
          <li class="admin-workflow-timeline-item">
            <div class="admin-workflow-timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
            <div class="admin-workflow-timeline-body">
              <h4 class="admin-workflow-timeline-heading">Onboarding decision</h4>
              <p>Complete your review of the client questionnaire and onboarding request through your agreed process (including outside this application if required). Record the outcome before creating access.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="admin-workflow-timeline-item">
            <div class="admin-workflow-timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true">2</div>
            <div class="admin-workflow-timeline-body">
              <h4 class="admin-workflow-timeline-heading">Register the organization</h4>
              <p>Add the client under <a href="/admin/companies">Organization management</a> so they exist as a tenant in the portal.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="admin-workflow-timeline-item">
            <div class="admin-workflow-timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true">3</div>
            <div class="admin-workflow-timeline-body">
              <h4 class="admin-workflow-timeline-heading">Create the manager</h4>
              <p>From that organization’s record, provision a manager account. They complete first sign-in, manage their users, and oversee documents for their organization.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="admin-workflow-timeline-item">
            <div class="admin-workflow-timeline-marker" aria-hidden="true">4</div>
            <div class="admin-workflow-timeline-body">
              <h4 class="admin-workflow-timeline-heading">Review documents and monitor activity</h4>
              <p>Use <a href="/documents">Documents</a> (filter by organization) to approve or reject uploads as required. Use <a href="/admin/users">Users</a> and <a href="/admin/audit">Audit log</a> for accountability and analysis.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
